<h3>History</h3>
<ul>
  <li>The pass rate of each recorded run.</li>
  <li>A table of the flakiest scenarios and a trend per scenario. Needs <code>history: true</code>.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Share it</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Copy summary</strong> puts a short text for Slack or a pull request on the clipboard.</li>
  <li><strong>Copy link</strong> keeps the current tab, search and filters in the link.</li>
  <li><strong>Download JSON</strong> and <strong>Print / PDF</strong> are in the toolbar.</li>
  <li>Every scenario has a permanent link, and the theme follows your system setting with a switch.</li>
  <li>It works from phone to wide screen.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Options</h2>
<div class="table-wrap"><table>
<thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td><code>outputFile</code></td><td>Where to write it. Default <code>reports/report.html</code>.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>title</code></td><td>The title at the top.</td></tr>
<tr><td><code>logLevel</code></td><td>The lowest level of log lines stored in the file.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
